    ณ D - Status line ..................... Bottom                           ณ
    ณ E - Local echo ...................... Off                              ณ
    ณ F - Add Line Feeds after CRs ........ Off                              ณ
    ณ G - Strip high bit (incoming data) .. Off                              ณ
    ณ H - Received Backspace destructive .. On                               ณ
>>>>> I - XON/XOFF software flow control .. On     <<<<< may be ON or OFF    ณ
>>>>> J - CTS/RTS hardware flow control ... On     <<<<< must be ON          ณ
>>>>> K - DSR/DTR hardware flow control ... On     <<<<< may be ON or OFF   ณ
