******* The Modem and dialing setup menu (Alt-O then M)

    ีอต Modem and dialing parameter setup ฦอออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออธ
    ณ                                                                         ณ
>>>>> A - Init string ......... ATZ1^M~~ATV1X6W2&B1&Q6&K3S0=0^M << The Best   ณ
    ณ								  ณModem      ณ
    ณ B - Dialing prefix 1 .... ATDP                              ณinit stringณ
    ณ C - Dialing prefix 2 .... ATDT				  ณI've found.ณ           ณ
    ณ D - Dialing prefix 3 .... ATDT1800                                      ณ
    ณ E - Dialing suffix ...... ^M                                            ณ
    ณ F - Connect string ...... CONNECT                                       ณ
    ณ G - No connect strings .. NO CARRIER             BUSY                   ณ
    ณ                           ERROR                  NO DIALTONE            ณ
    ณ H - Hang-up string ...... +++~~~ATH^M    <<<< Not really Necessary      ณ
    ณ I - Auto answer string .. ATS0=1^M                                      ณ
    ณ J - Dial cancel string .. ^Z                                            ณ
    ณ                                                                         ณ
    ณ K - Dial time ........... 60                                            ณ
    ณ L - Redial pause ........ 1                                             ณ
>>>>> M - Auto baud detect .... Off    <<<<<  Must be set to OFF              ณ
>>>>> N - Drop DTR to hangup .. On     <<<<<  This is preferred               ณ
